ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live全双工语音模型，ChatGPT实现实时交互与多任务处理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cloudflare与OpenAI启动研究试点项目，利用网络洞察信号优化AI搜索</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波开源全球首个面向具身智能的MoE架构视频基模LingBot-Video</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2ec76900d85a9f30d60cb2841d9f771c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月9日，蚂蚁灵波正式开源全球首个面向具身智能的视频基模LingBot-Video。该模型采用DiT+MoE架构，通过30B总参数与3B激活参数的配置，在保持视觉表达能力的同时，推理效率较同规模Dense架构提升约3倍。针对具身智能需求，模型引入7万小时包含VLA、VLN及Ego视角的机器人数据，并结合多维强化学习奖励系统，重点优化物理合理性与任务完成度。在RBench基准测试中，LingBot-Video以0.620的总分超越Wan2.6、Seedance1.5Pro等模型，表现出更强的动作一致性与物理规律建模能力。该模型旨在解决视频生成模型在机器人连续预测、规划及实时交互中的局限，可广泛应用于机器人动作预测、仿真数据生成及世界模型研究等领域，为具身智能领域提供了全新的开源技术底座。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceXAI发布Grok 4.5大模型，对标Opus性能并大幅降低推理成本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0b25c97062019acda18a7bf3a45673dd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceXAI正式发布最新大模型Grok 4.5，该模型定位为通用主力干将，具备代码编写、办公处理及研究写作等核心能力。马斯克称其性能达到Opus级，且运行速度更快。技术层面，Grok 4.5实现Token效率翻倍，显著降低了推理成本。定价策略极具竞争力，每百万输入Token收费2美元，输出Token收费6美元，远低于OpenAI及Anthropic同类高端模型。该模型将于次日向公众全面开放。在OpenAI即将推出GPT-5.6的背景下，SpaceXAI通过“高性能+高效率+低成本”的组合拳，进一步加剧了头部大模型市场的竞争格局，标志着AI行业进入白热化的“三国杀”阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布GPT-Live全双工语音模型，ChatGPT实现实时交互与多任务处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/eb645adaecc09c1da862e95e03a1fdc2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式发布基于GPT-Live架构的全新ChatGPT语音体验，通过全双工技术实现“同时说话、倾听和思考”的实时交互。该架构摒弃了传统“你说完我再答”的排队模式，模型可在用户停顿时自然插入“嗯哼”等语气反馈，并支持随时插话与逻辑即时调整。技术层面，GPT-Live深度集成GPT-Realtime-2模型，后台默认调用GPT-5.5处理联网搜索、深度推理及复杂任务规划，显著提升了语音场景下的长对话上下文追踪能力。此次发布包含GPT-Live-1与GPT-Live-1 mini两个版本：付费用户享有功能更全面的GPT-Live-1，免费用户则由mini版本驱动。同时，OpenAI已通过API向开发者和企业客户开放接入，支持构建新一代语音代理与垂类应用。此次升级标志着ChatGPT语音模式从简单的问答工具，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cloudflare与OpenAI启动研究试点项目，利用网络洞察信号优化AI搜索</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dfaa2fb61ef5b708e070130e6d9bac5a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月8日，Cloudflare与OpenAI正式启动深度研究试点项目，旨在通过Cloudflare的全球网络数据提升AI搜索引擎的实时性与准确性。Cloudflare将向OpenAI开放其独有的网络洞察信号，包括网页内容更新频率、流量趋势及页面变动轨迹。这些实时数据将作为AI系统的“网络风向标”，使模型不再仅依赖传统爬虫抓取，而是能更敏锐地捕捉互联网上的活跃信息流。此次合作通过底层网络设施与大模型应用端的深度协同，旨在解决AI领域常见的“知识滞后”与“检索偏差”痛点。该试点项目将直接优化AI在处理复杂问题时的响应效率与数据实效性，为用户提供更精准的实时资讯检索体验，标志着AI搜索领域正向更精细化的数据反馈机制演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
